;; fixture — beancount-reconcile eval1 (clean checking match, asset account)
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2026-04-01 open Assets:Bank:Checking USD
2026-04-01 open Income:Salary USD
2026-04-01 open Expenses:Food:Groceries USD
2026-04-01 open Expenses:Utilities USD
2026-04-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances

2026-04-30 * "Opening deposit"
  Assets:Bank:Checking   1000.00 USD
  Equity:Opening-Balances

2026-05-01 balance Assets:Bank:Checking   1000.00 USD

2026-05-03 * "PAYROLL DEPOSIT"
  Assets:Bank:Checking   2000.00 USD
  Income:Salary

2026-05-07 * "TRADER JOES #123"
  Assets:Bank:Checking    -54.20 USD
  Expenses:Food:Groceries

2026-05-15 * "CITY POWER"
  Assets:Bank:Checking    -80.00 USD
  Expenses:Utilities
